aiPrompt.skillPart2:
PROBE REFERENCE
These field lists describe semicolon-separated Error(string) reasons; numeric/address readings use KEY=VALUE and end with ;END. Required fields must match the chosen method exactly. Recheck ABI/selectors after Probe Beacon upgrades.

| Function | Selector | Revert fields |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `pingProbe()` | `0x62dedb93` | PONG;END (channel check) |
| `assetProbe()` | `0x80c8c302` | MARKET;QUOTE;DECIMALS;END |
| `marketProbe()` | `0x88c8da88` | POOL_WEI;CAP_WEI;ROOM_WEI;PHASE;BLOCK;END |
| `buyCapacityProbe()` | `0x593d2a74` | ROOM_SHARES;HELD_SHARES;LIMIT_SHARES;ID;PHASE;END |
| `positionProbe()` | `0x68036cac` | HELD_SHARES;FULL_SELL_WEI;SELL_OK;PHASE;BLOCK;END |
| `sharesProbe()` | `0x0ef4fec1` | SHARES;END |
| `actionStatusProbe()` | `0x331e21da` | BUY_OK;CLAIM_OK;PHASE;TOKEN;END |
| `claimableProbe()` | `0xfb0e3154` | CLAIM_RAW;STATE;PHASE;END |
| `launchRouteProbe()` | `0x766d6582` | TOKEN;PAIR;PHASE;END |
| `quoteBuyProbe(uint256 grossWei)` | `0xd620e44d` | SHARES;ACCEPT_WEI;FEE_WEI;REFUND_WEI;BLOCK;END |
| `buyPlanProbe(uint256 grossWei,uint256 slippageBps)` | `0x0f803438` | MIN_SHARES;BUY_SHARES;RULES_OK;BLOCK;END |
| `quoteSellBpsProbe(uint256 bps)` | `0xfe12dd21` | SHARES;OUT_WEI;BLOCK;END |
| `sellPlanCustomProbe(uint256 bps,uint256 slippageBps)` | `0xcceb5cad` | SHARES;OUT_WEI;MIN_WEI;BLOCK;END |
| `sellPlanProbe(uint256 bps)` | `0x309768d4` | SHARES;OUT_WEI;MIN_WEI;BLOCK;END (fixed 5% slippage) |
| `quoteSellSharesProbe(uint256 shares)` | `0x0717300a` | SHARES;OUT_WEI;MIN_WEI;BLOCK;END (fixed 5% slippage) |
| `holderRegistryProbe()` | `0x07f691d0` | COUNT;COMPLETE;TOTAL_SHARES;PHASE;BLOCK;END |
| `holderAtProbe(uint256 index)` | `0x2d58b248` | HOLDER;SHARES;IDX;COUNT;BLOCK;END |
| `walletStatsProbe()` | `0x8be476a7` | SPENT_WEI;RECEIVED_WEI;BUYS;SELLS;CLAIMS;END |
| `walletShareStatsProbe()` | `0xbacf903d` | BOUGHT;SOLD;CLAIMED;BALANCED;END |

HUMAN-READABLE ABI
PROBE (all *Probe methods are nonpayable, simulate only):
function pingProbe()
function assetProbe()
function marketProbe()
function buyCapacityProbe()
function positionProbe()
function sharesProbe()
function actionStatusProbe()
function claimableProbe()
function launchRouteProbe()
function quoteBuyProbe(uint256 grossWei)
function buyPlanProbe(uint256 grossWei,uint256 slippageBps)
function quoteSellBpsProbe(uint256 bps)
function sellPlanCustomProbe(uint256 bps,uint256 slippageBps)
function sellPlanProbe(uint256 bps)
function quoteSellSharesProbe(uint256 shares)
function holderRegistryProbe()
function holderAtProbe(uint256 index)
function walletStatsProbe()
function walletShareStatsProbe()
FACTORY / READER (optional ordinary reads for capable clients):
function probeOfMarket(address market) view returns (address)
PROBE (ordinary view, not a reverting read):
function market() view returns (address)
Do not require view return-value support from an AI client that only supports previews; use CONFIG plus assetProbe() for that client.
PORTAL (execute only after successful simulation and wallet confirmation):
function buy(address market,uint256 minShares) payable returns (uint256)
function sellBps(address market,uint256 bps,uint256 minOut) returns (uint256)
function claim(address market) returns (uint256)

Transaction selectors: buy=0xcce7ec13; sellBps=0x2f9d7c27; claim=0x1e83409a.
Use ABI encoding for calldata, never the Probe's reason text. Only Portal.buy carries grossWei; sellBps and claim use value=0.

FAILURE HANDLING
A plain NO_SHARES/MARKET_NOT_OPEN or other revert is an error, not a numeric reading. Stop the requested operation and return it unchanged. Missing ;END or essential fields means unreadable. For optional diagnostics, another compatible read may be used; do not switch financial routes. Do not retry confirmed claims merely because shares became zero. PENDING orders must not be duplicated. A client without the needed preview/receipt/route capability must report the limitation, not invent successful execution.

DEX EXIT: Use only a separately requested TOKEN→BNB exchange. Read the actual wallet TOKEN balance, obtain a fresh supported market-order quote, preview any route approval and swap separately, and confirm each through the wallet. FINISHED plus asset changes is success; PENDING must not be resubmitted. Probe launchRouteProbe() supplies no external price.

